cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "NAO Sensei — a NAO V5 robot lecturer with checkpoint Q&A"
abstract: >-
  NAO Sensei is a human–robot interaction project in which a NAO V5 humanoid
  delivers a prepared PowerPoint lecture to a small class. It narrates speaker
  notes verbatim, advances its own slides, and answers student questions at
  checkpoints. All intelligence (speech-to-text, a local LLM, and text-to-speech)
  runs on a Windows PC; the robot is an embodied output device driven over a
  thin HTTP bridge. Built for a university HRI course.
type: software
